WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.030
Episode 29

01:38.050 --> 01:41.090
My mind told me not to go,

01:42.770 --> 01:44.450
but I'm curious.

01:45.410 --> 01:46.810
What do you think?

01:47.260 --> 01:48.920
Up to you.

01:48.940 --> 01:52.410
She asked me to be nice to you.

01:54.220 --> 01:55.810
I don't understand.

01:56.820 --> 01:58.600
You're a martial arts master.

01:58.620 --> 02:00.320
You don't need me to take care of you, right?

02:03.260 --> 02:04.600
She said

02:05.220 --> 02:07.200
vitality Qi doesn't exist.

02:08.620 --> 02:11.610
It doesn't now that she said so.

02:15.620 --> 02:16.960
What is it?

02:16.980 --> 02:18.730
The thing I've been practicing.

02:18.820 --> 02:20.170
No idea.

02:22.540 --> 02:24.350
She said she'd give me an answer,

02:24.370 --> 02:25.420
but I ended up

02:25.420 --> 02:27.000
becoming more confused.

02:27.900 --> 02:30.170
It's just a trap.

02:31.980 --> 02:33.400
Uncle,

02:34.210 --> 02:35.420
I think

02:35.420 --> 02:36.570
I'd better

02:36.570 --> 02:37.810
forget about it.

02:38.420 --> 02:40.190
Now that I came here,

02:40.210 --> 02:42.070
I should live well here

02:42.090 --> 02:43.680
and take good care of people around me.

02:43.700 --> 02:44.890
Okay.

02:45.290 --> 02:46.680
But the premise is that

02:46.700 --> 02:48.450
nobody found you sneaking into the imperial harem.

02:48.450 --> 02:50.320
Don't worry. I did it without trace.

02:50.340 --> 02:52.120
Nobody could find it's me.

02:52.980 --> 02:54.170
Who is it?

02:56.140 --> 02:57.400
Your Excellency.

02:57.620 --> 02:59.970
Bad news. It's found out.

03:01.340 --> 03:01.980
Come in.

03:01.980 --> 03:03.450
What's found out?

03:03.780 --> 03:07.810
He knew almost everything.

03:07.930 --> 03:09.040
About what?

03:09.060 --> 03:09.850
Who?

03:09.850 --> 03:11.120
What's the matter? Make it clear.

03:11.140 --> 03:12.190
I

03:12.210 --> 03:14.430
was seeing that locksmith out of the capital city.

03:14.450 --> 03:15.850
Head and Master Shadow

03:15.850 --> 03:17.160
saw me and blocked my way.

03:17.180 --> 03:18.240
They asked me

03:18.260 --> 03:19.270
if it's you

03:19.290 --> 03:20.270
that sneaked into the imperial harem

03:20.290 --> 03:22.170
last night.

03:23.420 --> 03:25.680
Wang Qinian, did you tell the truth?

03:25.700 --> 03:26.420
I'm not stupid.

03:26.420 --> 03:28.040
Of course I didn't.

03:28.060 --> 03:28.850
And then?

03:28.850 --> 03:29.880
Then

03:29.900 --> 03:30.850
Master Shadow

03:30.850 --> 03:32.690
gave this key to me.

03:37.620 --> 03:39.450
This key.

03:40.980 --> 03:42.320
Is there anything special

03:42.340 --> 03:43.340
about it?

03:43.340 --> 03:44.450
Nah. There is nothing special

03:44.450 --> 03:45.620
about the key.

03:45.620 --> 03:47.010
It's just the key to the house

03:47.010 --> 03:48.270
of that locksmith.

03:48.290 --> 03:48.850
The locksmith

03:48.850 --> 03:49.820
that made the fake key last night?

03:49.820 --> 03:50.760
Exactly.

03:50.780 --> 03:51.450
Why did Shadow have the key

03:51.450 --> 03:52.800
to his house?

03:52.820 --> 03:56.000
The locksmith works for Head.

03:58.090 --> 04:00.040
I really have no idea about that.

04:00.060 --> 04:01.010
The locksmith has achieved fame

04:01.010 --> 04:01.980
in the capital city for years.

04:01.980 --> 04:03.470
And I've known him for a long time.

04:03.490 --> 04:04.850
He's never mentioned

04:04.850 --> 04:06.640
he knew Head.

04:07.140 --> 04:08.640
Your Excellency,

04:08.820 --> 04:10.330
you can imagine

04:10.570 --> 04:12.430
how many people in the capital city

04:12.450 --> 04:14.840
spy for Head.

04:14.930 --> 04:16.480
This is not a key.

04:16.890 --> 04:19.030
There's no such key

04:19.050 --> 04:20.600
or such lock in the world.

04:20.650 --> 04:21.610
The locksmith didn't know

04:21.610 --> 04:23.000
I sneaked into the imperial palace.

04:23.020 --> 04:25.680
Your Excellency, they're not fools.

04:25.700 --> 04:26.870
You weren't at home last night

04:26.890 --> 04:28.070
and someone broke into the imperial palace.

04:28.090 --> 04:29.310
You also went to the locksmith

04:29.330 --> 04:31.070
in nocturnal costume.

04:31.090 --> 04:31.770
All this proves

04:31.770 --> 04:33.250
it's you.

04:33.330 --> 04:34.920
What did Chen Pingping say?

04:35.420 --> 04:38.130
He asked me to pass on a message to you.

04:38.860 --> 04:40.400
Nobody else would know

04:40.420 --> 04:42.440
what he did last night.

04:42.820 --> 04:44.840
He can do whatever he wants.

04:44.860 --> 04:48.200
I'll patch up his lies.

04:48.460 --> 04:49.520
Tell Fan Xian

04:49.540 --> 04:51.290
he can trust me.

04:52.210 --> 04:53.030
It's a serious matter,

04:53.050 --> 04:54.760
but he just let it go.

04:54.930 --> 04:56.590
I think Head

04:56.610 --> 04:58.160
is trustworthy.

05:04.610 --> 05:06.120
As for what I'll do next,

05:06.140 --> 05:07.880
I want to do it myself.

05:08.020 --> 05:09.560
I'll ask him for help if necessary.

05:09.580 --> 05:10.800
Next?

05:10.820 --> 05:12.120
What do you want to do?

05:12.140 --> 05:13.470
I went to Guangxin Palace last night,

05:13.490 --> 05:15.690
so I didn't have time to put the fake key back.

05:16.090 --> 05:17.440
Huh?

05:17.700 --> 05:18.840
What to do?

05:18.860 --> 05:20.120
To put it back as soon as possible.

05:20.140 --> 05:21.190
I can't let others know

05:21.210 --> 05:22.910
about my real intention.

05:22.930 --> 05:24.400
Now that assassinators broke in last night,

05:24.420 --> 05:26.470
the imperial palace will be heavily guarded today.

05:26.490 --> 05:28.130
How could you go in again?

05:28.980 --> 05:30.750
I'll turn to someone who can do it anytime.

05:30.770 --> 05:32.440
Who is it?

05:32.740 --> 05:34.840
Even if he can,

05:34.860 --> 05:36.920
why should he do you a favor?

05:43.860 --> 05:45.090
Go to the imperial palace?

05:45.610 --> 05:46.910
It's not hard.

05:46.930 --> 05:48.750
I was brought up there.

05:48.770 --> 05:50.590
It's like my home.

05:50.610 --> 05:51.610
You have to find a way

05:51.610 --> 05:53.200
to get into the Empress Dowager's palace.

05:54.650 --> 05:56.040
No problem.

05:56.090 --> 05:57.280
Her Majesty is nice to me.

05:57.300 --> 05:59.130
I should go to see her.

05:59.460 --> 06:01.370
You have to take me there too.

06:03.210 --> 06:04.720
Okay.

06:04.770 --> 06:06.680
We're engaged.

06:06.700 --> 06:07.800
We should go there together

06:07.820 --> 06:09.250
to see her.

06:09.460 --> 06:10.590
That's not what I meant.

06:10.610 --> 06:11.590
I mean

06:11.610 --> 06:12.750
you take me there

06:12.770 --> 06:14.690
without letting others know it's me.

06:15.020 --> 06:15.960
Do you mean

06:15.980 --> 06:16.680
you can't go to the imperial palace

06:16.700 --> 06:18.480
in the name of Fan Xian?

06:18.610 --> 06:20.290
In whose name will you do that?

06:20.540 --> 06:22.010
A eunuch accompanying you.

06:24.650 --> 06:26.310
Disguised as a eunuch.

06:26.330 --> 06:29.090
A fake. I won't be a real one.

06:30.170 --> 06:32.720
You don't need to explain it.

06:34.090 --> 06:35.480
Is it okay?

06:36.020 --> 06:37.480
Yeah. Sure.

06:38.370 --> 06:41.010
Now that you want to pretend to be a eunuch,

06:41.930 --> 06:43.920
you have to learn something.

06:58.820 --> 07:00.720
Imagine I'm the Empress Dowager.

07:03.930 --> 07:05.440
Support me.

07:09.980 --> 07:12.760
How can you do it like that?

07:23.050 --> 07:24.760
I'm thirsty.

07:32.770 --> 07:34.010
Start again.

07:34.260 --> 07:35.310
What's wrong?

07:35.330 --> 07:36.750
You can't walk like that.

07:36.770 --> 07:38.040
It's noisy.

07:42.930 --> 07:43.740
Hold on.

07:43.740 --> 07:45.720
You're a eunuch.

07:47.580 --> 07:50.370
Take more, smaller steps.

07:52.540 --> 07:55.200
Look down.

08:00.930 --> 08:03.120
Your Highness, please have some tea.

08:03.140 --> 08:04.410
Your Majesty.

08:05.260 --> 08:07.600
Your Majesty, please have some tea.

08:08.170 --> 08:09.400
Kneel down.

08:09.420 --> 08:10.910
What?

08:10.930 --> 08:12.070
Kneel down.

08:12.090 --> 08:12.740
I...

08:12.740 --> 08:14.530
Do you want to go there or not?

08:17.740 --> 08:19.320
Just kidding.

08:22.580 --> 08:23.440
All right.

08:23.460 --> 08:25.010
That's all about etiquette.

08:27.140 --> 08:28.600
Sit down.

08:28.980 --> 08:31.000
I can take you there,

08:31.020 --> 08:31.910
but before I do that,

08:31.930 --> 08:32.910
you have to tell me

08:32.930 --> 08:35.010
why you want to go there.

08:37.700 --> 08:38.460
Last night,

08:38.460 --> 08:39.960
I sneaked into the imperial harem

08:41.100 --> 08:42.510
and stole something

08:42.530 --> 08:43.920
from the Empress Dowager's palace.

08:44.780 --> 08:46.040
It's something

08:46.530 --> 08:47.710
closely related to

08:47.730 --> 08:49.080
my mother's past.

08:49.340 --> 08:50.810
So, no matter what,

08:50.850 --> 08:52.270
I had to steal it yesterday

08:52.290 --> 08:54.650
and I have to return it today.

08:58.220 --> 08:59.560
It's a serious matter.

08:59.580 --> 09:01.470
Why did you tell me?

09:01.490 --> 09:02.840
I promised

09:03.580 --> 09:05.010
I'd never lie to you.

09:07.530 --> 09:11.040
You're really honest, the Poetic Genius Fan.

09:13.140 --> 09:15.560
"As fall wind hugs the chill dew,

09:15.580 --> 09:18.450
they outshine all worldly dates."

09:18.490 --> 09:19.920
Is it written by you?

09:20.370 --> 09:21.570
Yes.

09:22.820 --> 09:24.950
A poem is written to express the author's feelings.

09:24.970 --> 09:27.890
Who are you dating?

09:33.140 --> 09:34.250
You.

09:40.140 --> 09:42.350
"This love can be waited to become a memory,

09:42.370 --> 09:44.590
but at that time it was confusing and regretful."

09:44.610 --> 09:46.120
Who is in your memory?

09:46.140 --> 09:47.510
Why is it regretful?

09:47.530 --> 09:48.960
It's also you.

09:50.460 --> 09:51.800
I couldn't see you at that time,

09:51.820 --> 09:53.080
so it was regretful.

10:01.780 --> 10:03.390
"Holding hands we watch each other's falling tears.

10:03.410 --> 10:05.150
With lumps in our throats, we're lost for words."

10:05.170 --> 10:06.890
Whose hands were you holding?

10:07.220 --> 10:08.270
Who were you crying for?

10:08.290 --> 10:09.560
Still you.

10:09.580 --> 10:10.700
All the poems about emotions

10:10.700 --> 10:12.400
are for you.

10:12.730 --> 10:13.950
All for me?

10:13.970 --> 10:14.760
Yeah.

10:14.780 --> 10:15.370
Really?

10:15.370 --> 10:16.570
Sure.

10:21.020 --> 10:22.650
There is one more.

10:24.610 --> 10:26.520
One more.

10:27.220 --> 10:30.080
"Ten years, dead and living dim and draw apart."

10:30.340 --> 10:31.840
Is it also for me?

10:32.100 --> 10:34.890
It's like I've been dead for a long time.

10:36.820 --> 10:38.890
This is for my mom.

10:56.820 --> 10:58.390
More guards than usual.

10:58.410 --> 10:59.440
Your Highness,

10:59.460 --> 11:00.710
a thief broke in last night.

11:00.730 --> 11:02.470
Everyone is talking about that.

11:02.490 --> 11:03.710
Is it caught?

11:03.730 --> 11:05.040
No.

11:05.490 --> 11:06.340
It's said that guy

11:06.340 --> 11:07.340
was here to see

11:07.340 --> 11:09.150
the maidservant of the Princess Royal.

11:09.170 --> 11:10.760
The one like a cold fish?

11:10.780 --> 11:12.160
Exactly.

11:12.580 --> 11:14.280
She's not young.

11:14.340 --> 11:15.390
Yeah.

11:15.410 --> 11:17.650
She finally came across an infatuated man.

11:19.290 --> 11:23.510
A maidservant and an infatuated man.

11:23.530 --> 11:24.220
It...

11:24.220 --> 11:25.760
It's ridiculous.

11:25.780 --> 11:27.160
Who knows?

11:30.050 --> 11:31.480
Wan'er.

11:33.220 --> 11:35.400
Your Highness.

11:36.260 --> 11:38.200
I've heard Fan Xian wrote a lot of good poems

11:38.220 --> 11:40.920
at the Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest last night.

11:41.050 --> 11:41.880
He's well-known throughout the country

11:41.880 --> 11:42.820
=Consort Yi of Nanqing=
He's well-known throughout the country

11:42.820 --> 11:42.930
=Consort Yi of Nanqing=

11:42.930 --> 11:43.280
=Consort Yi of Nanqing=
as an outstanding poet.

11:43.280 --> 11:45.650
as an outstanding poet.

11:45.850 --> 11:47.610
The first time I saw him,

11:47.610 --> 11:49.520
I found he's a lovely guy.

11:50.530 --> 11:52.930
At that time, I thought he's just clever,

11:52.930 --> 11:55.460
but it turns out he's of so much talent.

11:55.460 --> 11:56.950
The two of you

11:56.970 --> 11:57.490
are really

11:57.490 --> 11:59.650
a perfect match.

12:00.700 --> 12:01.960
Your Highness.

12:03.700 --> 12:05.080
Where are you going?

12:05.100 --> 12:06.920
Are you feeling better?

12:07.340 --> 12:09.080
Thank you for your care.

12:09.100 --> 12:10.390
I haven't been here for a long time.

12:10.410 --> 12:11.710
I'd like to see Her Majesty.

12:11.730 --> 12:12.660
What a coincidence!

12:12.660 --> 12:14.370
I'm going that way too.

12:14.370 --> 12:15.770
Let's go together.

12:15.930 --> 12:17.210
Okay.

12:21.850 --> 12:24.210
Your Majesty, let me pay my respect to you.

12:24.340 --> 12:26.510
Rise.

12:26.530 --> 12:29.480
You're in poor health. You don't need to kneel.

12:30.900 --> 12:32.150
Your Majesty,

12:32.170 --> 12:33.590
through careful treatment,

12:33.610 --> 12:34.880
I've nearly recovered.

12:34.900 --> 12:36.920
Even so, I don't want you to kneel down.

12:37.580 --> 12:40.130
Come over.

12:46.220 --> 12:49.390
Why do you come here today?

12:49.410 --> 12:50.640
I haven't seen you for a long time.

12:50.660 --> 12:52.330
I miss you.

12:54.140 --> 12:56.330
You've taken several servants with you.

12:56.580 --> 12:58.760
I know you have a sweet tooth,

12:58.780 --> 12:59.680
so I've taken

12:59.700 --> 13:00.640
some cakes and cookies

13:00.660 --> 13:01.780
made by myself

13:01.780 --> 13:03.250
to you.

13:04.780 --> 13:07.760
I've heard fleas appeared in the imperial palace recently,

13:07.780 --> 13:09.370
so I've also taken some fumigants

13:09.370 --> 13:11.690
to get rid of them.

13:13.460 --> 13:15.330
Your love and devotion

13:15.410 --> 13:17.830
are beyond price.

13:17.850 --> 13:19.470
Good.

13:19.490 --> 13:21.080
Accept all these.

13:25.850 --> 13:28.010
Where is Eunuch Hong?

13:28.530 --> 13:31.770
A thief broke in last night,

13:32.220 --> 13:34.080
so I asked him to give a hand

13:34.100 --> 13:35.570
to His Majesty.

13:36.340 --> 13:37.760
Today is a lovely day.

13:37.780 --> 13:38.440
How about

13:38.460 --> 13:40.270
going to the back garden to enjoy flowers?

13:40.290 --> 13:41.000
Let them stay here

13:41.020 --> 13:42.470
and get rid of pests.

13:42.490 --> 13:43.960
Good idea.

13:44.050 --> 13:45.150
Let's go.

13:45.170 --> 13:45.900
Okay.

13:45.900 --> 13:47.370
Okay. Let's go.

13:49.970 --> 13:50.910
Today,

13:50.930 --> 13:53.010
I'll stay a little longer with you in the garden.

13:53.900 --> 13:55.450
Slow down.

13:57.140 --> 13:59.200
Getting fresh air

13:59.220 --> 14:01.000
is good for your health.

14:01.020 --> 14:01.910
Okay.

14:01.930 --> 14:03.850
Eating more meat and opening windows to let fresh air in

14:03.850 --> 14:05.920
are also good for your health.

14:07.100 --> 14:08.200
Am I right?

14:08.220 --> 14:09.810
Yeah.

14:10.930 --> 14:12.510
It's a beautiful sunny day.

14:12.530 --> 14:13.780
Let's have a walk.

14:13.780 --> 14:14.920
Okay.

14:19.930 --> 14:22.370
Your Highness, I've told him about it.

14:22.490 --> 14:24.450
The Beiqi mission is going to set off.

14:27.850 --> 14:30.400
Your Highness, are you still thinking about the assassinators?

14:33.820 --> 14:35.400
Why on earth

14:36.530 --> 14:38.400
did they come here?

14:38.490 --> 14:40.520
Didn't they aim to assassinate you?

14:41.050 --> 14:42.920
I always think something is going wrong with it.

14:44.220 --> 14:46.240
Are you sure they came from Dongyi Town?

14:46.260 --> 14:47.390
Eunuch Hong fought

14:47.410 --> 14:48.590
one of them

14:48.610 --> 14:50.890
and recognized the mental cultivation methods of Si Gujian.

14:51.290 --> 14:52.440
Really?

14:52.460 --> 14:54.270
Eunuch Hong chased him for a long time

14:54.290 --> 14:55.760
and fought him several times.

14:55.780 --> 14:57.690
He couldn't have got it wrong.

14:57.730 --> 14:59.150
Fought him several times?

14:59.170 --> 15:00.450
Yes.

15:01.140 --> 15:02.390
Chased him out of the imperial palace?

15:02.410 --> 15:03.390
That's right.

15:03.410 --> 15:04.840
When?

15:05.660 --> 15:07.330
Eunuch Hong mentioned

15:07.490 --> 15:09.840
he came across that assassinator at 11:00 p.m. or so.

15:09.900 --> 15:12.590
Then he realized it was a trick
to lure the tiger form the mountain?

15:12.610 --> 15:13.760
Exactly.

15:13.780 --> 15:15.320
When did you find the assassinator

15:15.340 --> 15:16.720
out of the imperial palace?

15:18.460 --> 15:19.880
Night watchmen had sounded gongs
to make the hours at that time.

15:19.900 --> 15:21.650
It was past 1:00 a.m.

15:22.020 --> 15:24.830
When Eunuch Hong was lured away at 11:00 p.m.,

15:24.850 --> 15:27.390
the second assassinator must've broken in.

15:27.410 --> 15:29.330
If he aimed to kill me,

15:29.610 --> 15:30.470
why didn't he come here

15:30.490 --> 15:32.200
until 1:00 a.m.?

15:32.220 --> 15:33.840
Where did he go

15:34.100 --> 15:35.720
during the past two hours?

15:39.730 --> 15:41.770
He just passed by my palace.

15:42.100 --> 15:44.960
He aimed to do something else.

15:47.340 --> 15:49.210
What does he want to do?

15:49.780 --> 15:51.010
Xiaoyi,

15:51.610 --> 15:54.080
ask everyone

15:54.100 --> 15:55.440
in the imperial palace

15:55.460 --> 15:57.000
to check if anything was stolen

15:57.020 --> 15:59.210
or something went wrong.

16:00.340 --> 16:02.040
Got it.

16:03.410 --> 16:05.080
Hold on.

16:06.410 --> 16:08.690
They may not listen to me.

16:08.730 --> 16:10.200
Go to Her Majesty

16:10.220 --> 16:11.220
and explain everything to her

16:11.220 --> 16:12.680
so that she can give an order.

16:12.700 --> 16:13.920
Got it.

16:16.490 --> 16:18.520
Is it Dongyi Town or not?

16:23.370 --> 16:24.140
I'm going to

16:24.140 --> 16:26.370
find out the truth soon.

16:28.220 --> 16:31.960
Interesting. I'm looking forward to it.

16:43.340 --> 16:44.920
It's fragrant.

16:45.100 --> 16:47.080
You're more beautiful than the flower.

17:45.050 --> 17:46.480
Director Yan.

17:54.500 --> 17:56.600
Her Majesty is having a walk in the garden.

17:56.650 --> 17:59.290
You can go there for her.

17:59.340 --> 18:00.440
Someone is inside?

18:00.460 --> 18:02.250
We're trying to get rid of pests through fumigation.

18:02.460 --> 18:04.080
I mean the inner room.

18:04.100 --> 18:05.230
Is anyone there?

18:05.250 --> 18:06.560
No.

18:16.130 --> 18:17.650
Director Yan.

18:19.010 --> 18:20.080
Director Yan.

18:20.100 --> 18:23.480
It's Her Majesty's palace. Don't forget the rules.

18:41.290 --> 18:44.270
What's Li Yunrui investigating?

18:44.290 --> 18:45.960
Her Highness worries the assassinators

18:45.980 --> 18:47.890
might have other intentions.

18:49.250 --> 18:50.650
Then

18:51.050 --> 18:52.440
make everyone in the imperial palace

18:52.460 --> 18:56.170
check their own place carefully.

18:56.530 --> 18:57.960
Got it.

19:03.170 --> 19:04.800
Let's go back.

19:04.820 --> 19:07.200
I have to check too.

19:09.130 --> 19:10.720
Got it.

19:13.620 --> 19:15.170
Slow down.

19:38.930 --> 19:41.930
All of you, wait here.

19:43.530 --> 19:45.250
You too.

20:39.890 --> 20:41.480
Someone is hidden in Her Majesty's palace?

20:41.500 --> 20:42.910
I heard the breathing,

20:42.930 --> 20:44.510
but that maidservant said nobody is there.

20:44.530 --> 20:45.840
Is it a man or a woman?

20:45.860 --> 20:47.440
I can't tell.

20:47.890 --> 20:50.030
But judging from the breathing,

20:50.050 --> 20:51.960
I think it can do Kung Fu.

20:52.770 --> 20:54.270
Is it Eunuch Hong?

20:54.290 --> 20:56.200
If it were Eunuch Hong,

20:56.220 --> 20:57.800
I couldn't have noticed it.

20:59.130 --> 21:01.410
Assassinators came last night

21:01.860 --> 21:04.320
and someone is hidden in Her Majesty's palace today.

21:04.620 --> 21:06.680
It's more than a coincidence.

21:07.100 --> 21:10.170
Are they related?

21:11.770 --> 21:13.890
In this case,

21:14.130 --> 21:15.100
it reminds me

21:15.100 --> 21:17.110
of what's weird about the case.

21:17.130 --> 21:18.910
It's indeed weird.

21:18.930 --> 21:20.370
Xiaoyi,

21:21.100 --> 21:23.630
is Hong Sixiang a Great Master?

21:23.650 --> 21:25.110
I didn't see him fight,

21:25.130 --> 21:26.220
but he's definitely more powerful than me.

21:26.220 --> 21:28.080
You're already above the Ninth Dan,

21:28.100 --> 21:29.530
so Hong Sixiang must be

21:29.530 --> 21:31.560
the most mysterious Great Master.

21:31.580 --> 21:33.130
I think so.

21:34.290 --> 21:36.480
The assassinator was chased by a Great Master

21:36.500 --> 21:38.320
but managed to escape.

21:38.500 --> 21:39.460
What kind of assassinator

21:39.460 --> 21:41.130
is so capable as to do that?

21:41.460 --> 21:43.110
Is it

21:43.130 --> 21:44.680
Si Gujian himself?

21:44.700 --> 21:46.320
It's really weird.

21:46.340 --> 21:47.220
What if

21:47.220 --> 21:49.080
he was lured away on purpose?

21:49.100 --> 21:50.200
On purpose?

21:50.220 --> 21:51.480
Why did the assassinator

21:51.500 --> 21:54.080
come and go freely?

21:54.250 --> 21:57.250
Why did he disappear without trace later on?

21:57.980 --> 21:59.580
Why did Hong Sixiang fail to catch him

21:59.580 --> 22:01.170
as a Great Master?

22:01.250 --> 22:02.050
There is only one answer

22:02.050 --> 22:03.720
that would make sense.

22:04.220 --> 22:08.290
The two assassinators work for Her Majesty.

22:19.980 --> 22:21.650
I don't know what to do to thank you.

22:22.620 --> 22:24.370
Write me a poem.

22:25.220 --> 22:26.530
Okay.

22:27.890 --> 22:29.250
I need to think about it.

22:30.410 --> 22:32.080
You wrote so many poems last night
even though you were drunk.

22:32.100 --> 22:33.750
Why do you need to think about it today?

22:33.770 --> 22:35.050
It's a different case.

22:35.250 --> 22:36.480
Those poems

22:36.500 --> 22:37.050
came to my mind

22:37.050 --> 22:38.360
themselves.

22:38.380 --> 22:39.650
I want to create one

22:39.650 --> 22:41.560
for you.

22:41.650 --> 22:43.560
They came to your mind themselves?

22:46.770 --> 22:47.910
They just came like that.

22:47.930 --> 22:49.600
I don't know where they're from.

22:51.290 --> 22:52.390
Are you really an immortal

22:52.410 --> 22:54.030
that's demoted to the mortal world?

22:54.050 --> 22:54.750
And those poems

22:54.770 --> 22:56.440
were created by you when you were in heaven?

22:56.460 --> 22:57.600
Where did you hear of that?

22:57.620 --> 22:58.870
Don't you know that?

22:58.890 --> 22:59.720
Overnight,

22:59.740 --> 23:02.290
it spread everywhere.

23:17.100 --> 23:19.600
Chapter 54. Section 86.

23:19.600 --> 23:20.170
=Xuan Jiu, Director of the Eighth Division=
Chapter 54. Section 86.

23:20.170 --> 23:21.550
=Xuan Jiu, Director of the Eighth Division
of the Investigator's Office of Nanqing=

23:32.340 --> 23:34.930
These are all good poems.

23:36.860 --> 23:37.740
But the source of some sentences

23:37.740 --> 23:39.480
is unknown.

23:40.770 --> 23:42.370
Take this line as an example.

23:43.130 --> 23:46.600
"Yellow River pouring from heaven."

23:47.010 --> 23:49.480
What is the Yellow River?

23:50.410 --> 23:51.890
A river that is yellow?

23:54.980 --> 23:56.530
And this line.

23:56.930 --> 24:00.250
"There are no clouds to one who has passed Mount Wu."

24:01.460 --> 24:03.680
There're numerous mountains and hills,

24:03.820 --> 24:07.840
Mount Wu is the name of a mountain?

24:09.500 --> 24:10.560
Your Excellency,

24:10.580 --> 24:12.720
it's not hard to understand.

24:12.860 --> 24:14.410
Go ahead.

24:14.580 --> 24:16.200
His Excellency Fan

24:16.620 --> 24:18.630
is the poetic genius from heaven.

24:18.650 --> 24:20.270
The unknown names of people and places

24:20.290 --> 24:22.110
and literary quotations

24:22.130 --> 24:24.480
are all from the fairyland.

24:25.130 --> 24:28.890
The Yellow River must be a river there.

24:28.980 --> 24:30.360
Does that hold water?

24:30.380 --> 24:31.100
Do you think an ordinary person

24:31.100 --> 24:32.100
could write so many excellent works

24:32.100 --> 24:34.250
overnight?

24:34.410 --> 24:37.530
It makes sense.

24:37.700 --> 24:39.320
This line is also well written.

24:39.340 --> 24:40.650
Explain it to me.

24:58.170 --> 24:58.890
Are there no records

24:58.890 --> 25:01.110
of these poems through the ages?

25:01.130 --> 25:02.910
We've looked through all books in stock in our divisions,

25:02.930 --> 25:04.150
but we've found nothing related.

25:04.170 --> 25:05.510
Please give us more time

25:05.530 --> 25:06.870
to look through ancient books.

25:06.890 --> 25:08.170
Don't bother.

25:08.580 --> 25:10.560
Get them approved

25:10.580 --> 25:12.870
and printed as soon as possible.

25:12.890 --> 25:14.170
Got it.

25:14.410 --> 25:15.680
Wait.

25:20.170 --> 25:21.650
Be careful.

25:27.650 --> 25:28.630
Head,

25:28.650 --> 25:30.320
it's common gossip that

25:30.340 --> 25:33.230
Fan Xian is the poetic genius from heaven.

25:33.250 --> 25:36.410
Shall we do something about it?

25:37.380 --> 25:40.410
The literary circles of Nanqing have been declining.

25:41.820 --> 25:43.720
It's time to have a poetic genius.

25:43.740 --> 25:45.050
I see.

25:45.860 --> 25:48.650
We'll add fuel to the flame

25:48.820 --> 25:51.890
to make everyone believe it's true.

25:52.500 --> 25:53.890
Go ahead.

26:20.220 --> 26:21.250
Are you also reading this book?

26:21.250 --> 26:21.740
Are you too?

26:21.740 --> 26:22.510
Good book.

26:22.530 --> 26:23.170
Good book.

26:23.170 --> 26:25.800
"On war-torn land streams flow and mountains stand.

26:25.820 --> 26:28.600
In vernal town grass and weeds are overgrown.

26:28.620 --> 26:30.620
Grieved over the years, flowers make us shed tears."

26:30.620 --> 26:31.700
Look at this line.

26:31.700 --> 26:33.080
"It's wrong to set goblets idle, in the glory of the moon."

26:33.100 --> 26:34.480
Wonderful!

26:34.500 --> 26:35.410
His Excellency Fan

26:35.410 --> 26:36.700
proves himself to be the poetic genius.

26:36.700 --> 26:37.800
Exactly.

26:37.820 --> 26:39.320
With this collection of poems printed,

26:39.340 --> 26:41.750
I'm afraid nobody would dare to write poems again.

26:41.770 --> 26:43.170
Absolutely.

26:43.530 --> 26:45.270
Having the poetic genius

26:45.290 --> 26:47.290
is a blessing for Nanqing.

26:47.770 --> 26:49.250
To be honest,

26:49.340 --> 26:51.230
I once worked with

26:51.250 --> 26:52.530
His Excellency Fan.

26:52.580 --> 26:54.720
At that time, I already thought

26:54.740 --> 26:57.230
he's eminent

26:57.250 --> 27:00.010
above all others.

27:15.580 --> 27:16.910
What is it?

27:16.930 --> 27:17.910
What is it?

27:17.930 --> 27:19.080
No idea.

27:19.620 --> 27:20.930
Who did it?

27:20.930 --> 27:22.600
Show it to me.

27:22.620 --> 27:24.370
There are more on the ground. Pick it up.

27:24.930 --> 27:26.800
There are words on it.

27:27.010 --> 27:28.890
Bro, look.

27:29.930 --> 27:31.800
There are so many.

27:32.170 --> 27:34.030
Who threw it?

27:34.050 --> 27:34.840
Let's pick one up.

27:34.860 --> 27:35.340
Let's have a look.

27:35.340 --> 27:37.130
It's confusing.

27:40.650 --> 27:42.890
Who wrote it?

27:43.580 --> 27:45.560
No idea. Forget about it.

27:45.580 --> 27:47.130
It's just a piece of paper.

27:47.170 --> 27:48.720
Pretend you didn't see it.

27:51.770 --> 27:54.010
Something serious is going to happen.

28:03.860 --> 28:06.010
You. Stop it.

28:07.050 --> 28:08.930
Go on reading.

28:10.410 --> 28:12.480
...ignores social order and law and has ferocious ambition.

28:12.500 --> 28:13.960
What's worse,

28:13.980 --> 28:16.600
knowing some honest patriots are lurking in Beiqi,

28:17.890 --> 28:19.870
Li Yunrui is so fatuous and evil-minded

28:19.890 --> 28:21.030
that she forgets about national interest

28:21.050 --> 28:24.320
and betrays loyal patriots to the enemy.

28:26.010 --> 28:27.320
Your Highness,

28:27.380 --> 28:29.440
there are even harsher words.

28:30.500 --> 28:31.720
Where did you get it?

28:31.890 --> 28:33.800
It was scattered in every corner of the capital city.

28:33.820 --> 28:35.230
Almost everyone read it.

28:35.250 --> 28:36.560
A lot of them

28:38.220 --> 28:40.010
kind of believe it.

28:42.170 --> 28:43.560
Who scattered them?

28:43.820 --> 28:45.370
We have no clues.

28:46.980 --> 28:48.480
It's interesting.

28:49.580 --> 28:50.910
They want to get me into trouble

28:50.930 --> 28:52.290
by spreading gossip.

28:54.290 --> 28:55.960
Others' opinions are not important.

28:56.340 --> 28:57.360
The key lies in

28:57.380 --> 28:59.770
how His Majesty thinks about it.

29:09.930 --> 29:12.410
The criticism is incisive.

29:14.530 --> 29:15.890
Who wrote it?

29:16.220 --> 29:17.800
How many people have read it?

29:17.890 --> 29:19.480
I'm afraid everyone has.

29:19.500 --> 29:20.630
Nowadays,

29:20.650 --> 29:22.720
it's widely discussed among people.

29:22.740 --> 29:23.750
They're talking about

29:23.770 --> 29:26.910
the Princess Royal's love affair with Zhuang Mohan.

29:26.930 --> 29:28.320
Ridiculous.

29:31.740 --> 29:32.930
Your Majesty,

29:33.250 --> 29:36.130
is it true that the Princess Royal

29:36.130 --> 29:38.010
betrayed Yan Bingyun?

29:40.010 --> 29:42.080
Why do you ask me?

29:43.380 --> 29:46.170
Isn't it the Investigator's Office's duty?

29:46.890 --> 29:48.650
Shall we find the truth out?

29:48.740 --> 29:51.080
It has provoked much discussion.

29:51.340 --> 29:53.800
It's better to put an end to it.

29:55.460 --> 29:58.290
Your Majesty, do you need an end to it or

29:59.620 --> 30:01.080
the truth?

30:03.050 --> 30:04.080
How dare you?

30:04.100 --> 30:07.080
I can punish you for your great disrespect.

30:08.500 --> 30:10.480
I'll accept the punishment.

30:13.500 --> 30:15.370
I don't mind if you want to die.

30:15.860 --> 30:17.200
You can leave.

30:26.530 --> 30:27.840
Your Excellency.

30:36.460 --> 30:38.290
Did you read this?

30:45.530 --> 30:47.250
The Princess Royal colluded with Beiqi?

30:47.250 --> 30:49.130
She betrayed Bingyun?

30:52.290 --> 30:54.080
Where did you get it?

30:54.250 --> 30:55.510
It can be found everywhere on the streets.

30:55.530 --> 30:56.930
Who distributed it?

30:57.740 --> 30:59.010
Heaven knows.

30:59.860 --> 31:01.600
Let me make it clear.

31:01.620 --> 31:03.510
If my son was arrested because of exposing his identity,

31:03.530 --> 31:05.130
I'll have nothing to complain about.

31:05.460 --> 31:06.530
But if it's because

31:06.530 --> 31:08.320
someone in Nanqing played a trick,

31:08.700 --> 31:11.080
I won't leave it at that.

31:15.820 --> 31:18.230
Why didn't you tell Head?

31:18.250 --> 31:20.050
I don't trust him.

31:20.700 --> 31:22.390
Few guys know that

31:22.410 --> 31:24.010
Bingyun is in Beiqi.

31:24.770 --> 31:26.200
Do you suspect

31:26.220 --> 31:28.680
it's Head that betrayed him?

31:28.770 --> 31:30.480
He wants to promote Fan Xian.

31:30.930 --> 31:32.530
Among the younger generation,

31:32.620 --> 31:34.290
my son is the biggest rival

31:34.290 --> 31:36.200
of Fan Xian.

31:42.340 --> 31:43.800
Let's update each other

31:43.930 --> 31:46.080
on anything new.

31:58.860 --> 31:59.870
We're making a big deal out of it.

31:59.890 --> 32:01.800
I'd like to see how Li Yunrui would end up.

32:01.820 --> 32:03.360
Uncle, I'm lucky to have you.

32:03.380 --> 32:05.030
Nobody else could have

32:05.050 --> 32:06.680
scattered them all over the city

32:06.700 --> 32:08.170
without letting others know.

32:08.930 --> 32:10.290
Is it of help?

32:10.620 --> 32:12.680
Uncle, gossip is a fearful thing.

32:12.770 --> 32:14.800
Besides, this is true.

32:14.820 --> 32:16.600
Li Yunrui can't afford to be investigated.

32:17.170 --> 32:17.960
Do you know

32:17.980 --> 32:19.560
what's best about this method?

32:19.580 --> 32:20.600
No.

32:20.620 --> 32:21.750
Do you want to know?

32:21.770 --> 32:23.130
No.

32:23.380 --> 32:25.080
I won't bother to ask you any questions.

32:25.100 --> 32:27.440
What's best about it is that

32:27.620 --> 32:30.410
nobody could find out it's me behind this.

32:30.500 --> 32:32.110
So, I can stay out of it

32:32.130 --> 32:33.960
and watch the show.

32:37.890 --> 32:41.010
It's me, Chen Pingping.

32:47.620 --> 32:49.080
Why are you here?

32:49.100 --> 32:50.650
To see you.

33:06.740 --> 33:08.130
Is Wuzhu not here?

33:08.250 --> 33:09.560
What's the matter?

33:24.620 --> 33:25.480
Well.

33:25.500 --> 33:26.720
I've read it.

33:26.890 --> 33:28.320
It's hard to imagine

33:28.340 --> 33:30.110
the Princess Royal

33:30.130 --> 33:31.480
has a love affair

33:31.500 --> 33:32.680
with such an old man.

33:32.700 --> 33:34.390
It's you that did it.

33:34.410 --> 33:35.100
You have no evidence.

33:35.100 --> 33:36.320
Please don't say that.

33:36.340 --> 33:38.170
The evidence is what you're holding in your hand.

33:46.770 --> 33:48.110
They're scattered everywhere in the capital city.

33:48.130 --> 33:50.680
I had a few copies taken back.

33:50.700 --> 33:52.010
Check it out.

33:59.050 --> 34:01.080
The paper is made from blue sandalwood.

34:03.580 --> 34:04.630
Due to different abilities to absorb water,

34:04.650 --> 34:06.680
such paper can be classified into

34:06.700 --> 34:07.920
raw paper, ripe paper

34:07.940 --> 34:09.600
and half-ripe paper.

34:24.900 --> 34:26.240
Head,

34:28.180 --> 34:29.800
this is half-ripe paper.

34:32.660 --> 34:35.240
A lot of the bark of blue sandalwood
has been used, so it's also called "Jingpi".

34:37.490 --> 34:40.170
It has two layers in thickness.

34:40.290 --> 34:42.800
Paper curtains with double silk lines
are used to form the grain pattern.

34:46.380 --> 34:48.040
In addition to straws,

34:49.620 --> 34:50.950
mulberry and hemp are also used as auxiliary material.

34:50.970 --> 34:52.400
It's produced in Hexi Circuit.

34:52.420 --> 34:54.640
Such paper is not of high quality,

34:54.660 --> 34:56.160
so it's seldom used in the capital city.

34:56.180 --> 34:57.230
Head,

34:57.250 --> 34:59.970
are there a large number of copies?

35:00.420 --> 35:01.970
They can be found everywhere in the capital city.

35:02.010 --> 35:04.450
Only one place

35:04.690 --> 35:06.450
has such a large amount of stock.

35:08.770 --> 35:09.990
In the whole capital,

35:10.010 --> 35:12.270
only Danbo Bookstore

35:12.290 --> 35:14.210
has purchased such paper.

35:14.580 --> 35:16.650
You're the one behind this.

35:23.660 --> 35:25.160
Are you short of money

35:25.180 --> 35:27.240
so that you purchased such poor quality products?

35:29.180 --> 35:30.840
Fan Sizhe is responsible for this.

35:30.860 --> 35:33.210
He'd save every penny he can.

35:35.250 --> 35:36.470
Among the eight divisions of the Investigator's Office,

35:36.490 --> 35:37.920
I've paid least attention to

35:37.940 --> 35:39.210
the Eighth Division.

35:39.660 --> 35:41.280
Unbelievable.

35:41.340 --> 35:44.370
The Investigator's Office was set up by your mother.

35:44.530 --> 35:46.520
Don't look down upon it.

35:49.770 --> 35:52.080
Did many people know about it?

35:52.100 --> 35:54.690
Nobody did. I got it fixed.

35:57.140 --> 35:59.000
Is it true or false?

36:00.900 --> 36:02.080
The love affair part is false,

36:02.100 --> 36:03.360
but the betrayal part is true.

36:03.380 --> 36:04.120
How did you know that?

36:04.140 --> 36:05.190
I heard it with my own ears.

36:05.210 --> 36:08.000
You heard it when you sneaked
into the imperial harem that night.

36:13.580 --> 36:15.920
Do you want to deal with the Princess Royal?

36:15.940 --> 36:17.280
She wants to kill me.

36:17.490 --> 36:19.280
I can't sit still waiting for my death, right?

36:23.050 --> 36:25.690
Only spreading gossip is not enough.

36:25.730 --> 36:27.190
You have to provide evidence.

36:27.210 --> 36:28.750
I planned to take the second step.

36:28.770 --> 36:29.510
I think

36:29.530 --> 36:30.800
there is someone who's of use.

36:30.820 --> 36:32.750
Guo Youzhi, Minister of the Board of Rites.

36:32.770 --> 36:33.710
How did you know that?

36:33.730 --> 36:35.560
I've heard what happened at the banquet that night.

36:35.940 --> 36:36.990
I'll be here today.

36:37.010 --> 36:39.160
I'll watch you hit rock bottom and ruin your name

36:39.180 --> 36:40.730
with my own eyes.

36:43.450 --> 36:44.890
My son is so rude.

36:45.100 --> 36:47.320
Your Excellency Fan, please forgive him.

36:47.450 --> 36:48.560
Who are you?

36:48.580 --> 36:50.510
This is Guo Youzhi,

36:50.530 --> 36:52.120
Minister of the Board of Rites.

36:52.140 --> 36:54.800
By making up such an absurd story,
he lied to Your Majesty.

36:54.820 --> 36:57.080
Your Majesty, I beg you to punish him!

36:57.100 --> 36:59.410
According to Guo Baokun,

36:59.580 --> 37:02.000
he knew that

37:02.140 --> 37:04.280
Zhuang Mohan made a false charge.

37:04.420 --> 37:05.670
If the Princess Royal

37:05.690 --> 37:07.990
wants to contact Zhuang Mohan,

37:08.010 --> 37:11.130
there must be an official who acts as an intermediary.

37:12.050 --> 37:13.690
Guo Baokun is not qualified,

37:14.530 --> 37:16.800
so it must be his father,

37:16.940 --> 37:18.080
Guo Youzhi.

37:18.100 --> 37:19.930
It turns out you also thought of it.

37:20.010 --> 37:22.180
I've paid much attention to your thing.

37:22.180 --> 37:23.920
But it's just a guess.

37:23.940 --> 37:24.950
I've got an idea

37:24.970 --> 37:26.190
to prove Zhuang Mohan

37:26.210 --> 37:27.990
has collided with Guo Youzhi.

37:28.010 --> 37:29.820
You can take advantage of
Zhuang Mohan's disappearance

37:29.820 --> 37:30.880
upon his first arrival in the capital city.

37:30.900 --> 37:32.320
You also knew that?

37:33.290 --> 37:34.800
Judging from the current situation,

37:35.290 --> 37:36.470
Zhuang Mohan

37:36.490 --> 37:39.320
did meet the Princess Royal.

37:39.340 --> 37:40.800
Someone must have done something

37:40.820 --> 37:42.160
to deceive the public.

37:42.180 --> 37:43.950
That's why he was taken away from his residence.

37:43.970 --> 37:44.730
We can try to find out

37:44.730 --> 37:46.120
who Zhuang Mohan met that day.

37:46.140 --> 37:47.360
I've done that.

37:47.380 --> 37:49.450
Guo Youzhi was one of them.

37:50.420 --> 37:52.270
You must also have guessed

37:52.290 --> 37:53.890
what I'd say next.

37:55.180 --> 37:56.600
Let me think about it.

37:56.970 --> 37:58.280
I'll think about it.

37:59.690 --> 38:01.040
These are still not enough.

38:01.730 --> 38:03.080
We need witnesses.

38:03.100 --> 38:04.160
Did you get one?

38:04.180 --> 38:06.490
We caught his carter who confessed everything.

38:06.770 --> 38:08.400
He said he took Zhuang Mohan away

38:08.420 --> 38:11.510
secretly that night

38:11.530 --> 38:12.430
and someone picked him up

38:12.450 --> 38:14.230
at the imperial harem.

38:14.250 --> 38:15.970
What should be done has been done.

38:16.340 --> 38:19.040
What do you want to do next?

38:20.340 --> 38:23.040
That's what I want to ask you.

38:26.940 --> 38:28.670
I want to drive Li Yunrui

38:28.690 --> 38:30.320
out of the capital city.

38:32.100 --> 38:33.930
Look at it yourself.

38:52.680 --> 38:55.550
=Carter confessed that it's Guo Youzhi,
Minister of the Board of Rites who took Zhuang Mohan away...=

38:59.820 --> 39:02.190
Guo Youzhi is indeed one of my followers.

39:02.210 --> 39:03.840
It's also true

39:03.860 --> 39:05.230
I met Zhuang Mohan.

39:05.250 --> 39:06.600
Did you confess your crime?

39:06.620 --> 39:09.030
Zhuang Mohan is a literary giant.

39:09.050 --> 39:12.730
I had some questions about
the ancient prose I was reading,

39:12.770 --> 39:13.950
so I invited him to my place

39:13.970 --> 39:16.040
to consult him.

39:16.490 --> 39:18.650
As for betraying Yan Bingyun,

39:18.770 --> 39:20.080
it's sheer nonsense.

39:20.100 --> 39:21.730
Reading ancient prose?

39:22.010 --> 39:23.600
I'm sure you can find out the truth.

39:28.580 --> 39:30.370
Do you have any question?

39:32.340 --> 39:33.360
Let's forget about

39:33.380 --> 39:35.000
the ancient prose for a while.

39:35.730 --> 39:37.950
The imperial harem should not meddle in politics,

39:37.970 --> 39:41.600
but Her Highness won over Guo Youzhi in private,

39:41.620 --> 39:44.930
which proves she ganged up for selfish interests.

39:46.050 --> 39:47.230
Are you convinced?

39:47.250 --> 39:48.840
Now that Head said so,

39:48.860 --> 39:50.410
of course I'm convinced.

39:53.250 --> 39:55.080
What should we do?

39:55.420 --> 39:57.360
As a court official,

39:57.380 --> 39:58.800
Guo Youzhi ganged up with the imperial harem.

39:58.820 --> 40:01.880
He should be turned over
to the Ministry of Penalty according to law.

40:01.900 --> 40:04.450
Won't you even try to protect your follower?

40:04.690 --> 40:06.280
The law is the law.

40:06.490 --> 40:08.760
Guo Youzhi brought it on himself.

40:10.940 --> 40:14.280
You've proved yourself to be one of the royal family.

40:20.420 --> 40:22.730
Quick. Quick!

40:29.860 --> 40:30.840
Dad!

40:30.860 --> 40:31.450
Master.

40:31.450 --> 40:33.230
Dad!

40:33.250 --> 40:34.560
Let me go over.

40:34.580 --> 40:35.800
My dad serves as Board of Rites.

40:35.820 --> 40:36.750
He's an official of standard class, second rank.

40:36.770 --> 40:38.190
The Ministry of Penalty has no right to arrest him.

40:38.210 --> 40:39.800
Dad! Dad!

40:39.820 --> 40:40.450
Master.

40:40.450 --> 40:41.210
How dare you?

40:41.210 --> 40:42.230
I'll go to His Majesty and complain.

40:42.250 --> 40:43.370
Step aside.

40:43.820 --> 40:44.620
Master.

40:44.620 --> 40:45.230
Dad.

40:45.250 --> 40:45.990
Master.

40:46.010 --> 40:47.800
Dad. Dad.

40:47.820 --> 40:49.270
Loosen your grip. Go away.

40:49.290 --> 40:52.450
Dad! Dad! Dad!

40:52.450 --> 40:54.180
Dad. Loosen your grip.

40:54.180 --> 40:55.920
-Let me say something to him. -Let go of me.

40:55.940 --> 40:57.120
I won't make things difficult for you.

40:57.140 --> 40:58.860
Dad! Dad!

40:58.860 --> 41:01.210
Let go of me!

41:01.620 --> 41:04.410
Dad! Dad!

41:04.820 --> 41:06.130
Dad.

41:06.490 --> 41:08.160
I have to save you.

41:08.180 --> 41:10.800
Alright. It's of no use.

41:10.820 --> 41:12.370
Can't you see it?

41:12.620 --> 41:14.130
Besides guys from the Ministry of Penalty,

41:14.690 --> 41:17.490
some imperial guards are also here.

41:18.250 --> 41:19.650
You still don't understand?

41:21.580 --> 41:23.560
They did it by His Majesty's order.

41:25.010 --> 41:27.030
How could it be like this?

41:27.050 --> 41:29.240
I shouldn't have let you

41:30.250 --> 41:32.600
go to the Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest that day.

41:32.620 --> 41:34.450
I should have been more careful.

41:34.580 --> 41:36.560
I shouldn't have told you about that thing.

41:36.970 --> 41:39.210
At the Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest...

41:42.210 --> 41:44.560
You shouldn't have said those words to Fan Xian.

41:45.100 --> 41:48.170
It wouldn't matter if he really lost his reputation,

41:48.900 --> 41:51.730
but now he's acclaimed as the poetic genius.

41:52.620 --> 41:53.970
I knew

41:54.690 --> 41:56.840
it would happen sooner or later.

41:57.860 --> 41:59.730
Dad. It's my fault.

42:01.380 --> 42:04.000
I don't blame you. It's my fault.

42:05.010 --> 42:08.520
Kun'er, from now on,

42:08.620 --> 42:11.430
you have to make a clean break with me.

42:11.450 --> 42:12.750
Remember.

42:12.770 --> 42:14.860
Try your best to send in memorials

42:14.860 --> 42:16.670
to attack me and abuse me.

42:16.690 --> 42:18.270
Say that I have wild ambition

42:18.290 --> 42:19.750
and you can't bear it anymore.

42:19.770 --> 42:21.040
Got it?

42:21.140 --> 42:22.600
No.

42:23.010 --> 42:24.470
Only in this way

42:24.490 --> 42:25.920
will you not get caught in trouble.

42:25.940 --> 42:28.210
No! No!

42:31.010 --> 42:32.890
I often criticize you,

42:34.250 --> 42:36.000
but from the bottom of my heart,

42:36.530 --> 42:38.280
I hope to see you

42:38.490 --> 42:42.240
rise in the official world and get married.

42:42.900 --> 42:44.950
I want to protect you all the way,

42:44.970 --> 42:48.800
but I can't do it anymore.

43:11.800 --> 43:15.380
In the river of history,

43:15.400 --> 43:18.870
time goes round and round.

43:21.680 --> 43:25.020
Memories about the former and present lives

43:25.040 --> 43:29.110
join each other in an endless way.

43:31.000 --> 43:33.620
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:33.640 --> 43:35.880
one season follows another in a flash,

43:35.880 --> 43:38.380
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:38.400 --> 43:40.000
I just can't give up

43:40.000 --> 43:43.340
to be with you for my whole life.

43:43.360 --> 43:48.830
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:50.080 --> 43:52.630
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:52.920 --> 43:54.960
Year after year in the wandering,

43:54.960 --> 43:57.620
I count the remaining years.

43:57.640 --> 43:59.820
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

43:59.840 --> 44:01.830
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:02.120 --> 44:04.510
I never feel regretful.

44:04.560 --> 44:05.920
In such a chaotic world,

44:05.920 --> 44:08.900
I still miss you as ever.

44:08.920 --> 44:11.870
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:12.160 --> 44:14.220
With a gentle heart,

44:14.240 --> 44:16.900
I cherish our remaining years.

44:16.920 --> 44:18.440
Even though we have to go through

44:18.440 --> 44:20.950
all the hardships along the journey,

44:21.080 --> 44:28.270
you always stay by my side,

44:28.360 --> 44:31.030
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:31.320 --> 44:33.400
Year after year in the wandering,

44:33.400 --> 44:36.060
I count the remaining years.

44:36.080 --> 44:38.220
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:38.240 --> 44:40.470
even though we end up the destiny,

44:40.680 --> 44:42.860
I never feel regretful.

44:42.880 --> 44:44.280
In such a chaotic world,

44:44.280 --> 44:47.340
I still miss you as ever.

44:47.360 --> 44:50.470
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:50.560 --> 44:52.700
With a gentle heart,

44:52.720 --> 44:55.420
I cherish our remaining years.

44:55.440 --> 44:56.880
Even though we have to go through

44:56.880 --> 44:59.540
all the hardships along the journey,

44:59.560 --> 45:08.320
you always stay by my side...
